'''Singularityville''' (シンギュラリティ村 ''Shingyurariti-mura'', '''Singularity Village''') is the 46th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter has a level of difficulty that varies depending on the stage, your cats and your [[Treasure]]s from [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. You will need a large variety of units, but no stage is particularly difficult. The last stage can be cheesed relatively easily, through stacking [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]]/[[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]]/[[:Category:Explosion Cats|Explosion]] units. [[8K Fertilizer]] can also be rather difficult if not approached with the right strategy.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[UltraBaaBaa]]: A [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Baa Baa]] with an extremely strong [[Barrier]], as strong as [[Youcan]]'s, but a minuscule amount of health and range.

