==Trivia==
*In futurology, [[wikipedia:Technological singularity|the singularity]] is a hypothetical event in which technology rapidly advances beyond the point that it can be controlled or predicted, starting an era so different as to be incomprehensible to those who came before it. Most of Singularityville's stages follow this theme by being named after different technologies:
**[[Ubiquitous Sales]] = [[wikipedia:Ubiquitous computing|ubiquitous computing]]
**[[Virtual Harvest]] = [[wikipedia:virtual reality|virtual reality]]
**[[Wearable Homes]] = [[wikipedia:Wearable technology|wearable technology]]
**[[8K Fertilizer]] = [[wikipedia:8K resolution|8K resolution]]
**[[Blockchain Twilight]] = [[wikipedia:Blockchain|blockchain]]

